          "type": "design-system",
          "title": "Design system",
          "scope": [
            "demo-app/src/components/**",
            "demo-app/src/styles/**"
          ],
          "body": "# Design system\n\n- All colours come from tokens in `demo-app/src/styles/tokens.css`. No hex values in components.\n- Severity uses the `--color-sev-*` tokens. Never rely on colour alone: always show the severity word too.\n- Use `Table` for lists of records; do not build raw tables. First column left-aligned.\n- Use `Badge` for status and severity labels.\n- Muted or collapsed rows use `--color-row-muted`.\n- Text must meet WCAG AA contrast (4.5:1) against its background."
        },
        {
          "id": "personas.md",
          "type": "persona",
          "title": "Personas",
          "scope": [
            "demo-app/src/screens/**"
          ],
          "body": "# Personas\n\n## Dana — Tier-1 SOC analyst (primary)\nWorks the alert queue all shift. Needs to spot what is dangerous *right now* without opening\nevery alert. Judges urgency by severity and by what the affected asset is.\n\n## Omer — Incident lead\nPicks up escalated incidents and approves containment. The only role allowed to isolate hosts.\n\n## Lior — CISO (viewer)\nRead-only. Looks at the posture overview before leadership meetings."
        },
        {
          "id": "product.md",
          "type": "product",
          "title": "Sentinel",
          "scope": [
            "demo-app/**"
          ],
          "body": "# Sentinel\n\nSentinel is a security operations console for mid-size companies. It pulls alerts from\nEDR, SIEM, cloud and email security tools into one queue. A small SOC team triages them,\nopens incidents for real threats, and runs containment.\n\n## Core jobs\n1. Triage the alert queue: find the few alerts that matter among hundreds.\n2. Investigate an incident and decide on containment.\n3. Report posture to leadership.\n\n## Success metric for this quarter\nMean time to triage (MTTT) for critical alerts on crown-jewel assets. Target: under 5 minutes."
        }
      ],
